The '''Lapis Miner''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Lapis Quarry}}. They request the player to bring them a {{Item|Lapis Pickaxe}}, which will be consumed upon completing of the {{Quest|Helpful Miner}} quest. The player will receive a {{Item|Compactor}} as a reward.

