== Trivia ==
*The '''Lapis Miner''' and {{NPCSprite|Redstone Miner}} are siblings.
*The '''Lapis Miner''' used to ask for an iron pickaxe instead of a {{Item|Lapis Pickaxe}}.
**There used to be a bug where when clicked multiple times, the '''Lapis Miner''' would consume multiple iron pickaxes from player's inventory.

